WEBVTT

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.350
Damn! When is this
night going to end?!

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.350
Just a bit longer! Be patient.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.390
Absolutely! If you go out now,

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.100
Naraku will find
out the exact time

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.770
when you lose your
demonic powers…

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.360
I'm going.

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:55.740
Kagome!

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:00.120
Don't let your guard down!

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.060
It's so quiet.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:38.860
Father!

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:40.120
Kohaku!

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.200
This is the moment when
I avenge all of you!

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:48.420
Naraku!

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.220
Kirara!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.480
Miroku! He's headed your way!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.110
I've been waiting, Naraku!

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:19.860
Here is the curse
you set upon me…

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:21.990
Wind Tunnel!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.460
Saimyosho?!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:37.460
Die!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.220
Impudent wench!

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:46.430
Naraku! Prepare to die!

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.270
Got him!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.110
Kagome! Get down!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.570
Transform!

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.370
Miroku!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.130
Is that Naraku's
true appearance?!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:20.920
Kagome!

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.340
Where's Inuyasha?

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.680
It can't be helped.
We'll do it without him.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.310
Let's go, Kirara!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.480
Shippo, are you ready?

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.140
Yup!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.730
How about we wait
'til next time?

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.480
Shippo…

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:46.740
A barrier?!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.540
All right! I'll go!

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.420
Good job, Shippo! Pterodactyl?

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.540
No, a seagull…

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:01.720
It's coming!

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.630
Don't run away!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.180
But I'm still only a kid!

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.480
Aim for its legs to
stop his movement!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.360
Kirara! Dive under its belly...

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.860
What are you doing
at a time like this!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:21.990
Forgive me,
I couldn't help myself.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.400
Keep your hands to yourself!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.740
What the heck are they doing?!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.580
I can't stand it!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.580
Please wait! Stay here and…

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.540
Shaddup!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.580
Smushed!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.540
Kagome!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:44.680
Inuyasha!

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.930
Inuyasha…!

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:05.450
That's…!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.990
The night has ended!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.320
He made it!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.750
Sorry to keep ya
waiting, Naraku.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.130
THE CASTLE BEYOND THE LOOKING GLASS

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:25.950
I'll be the one to take you on!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.580
INUYASHA
A HALF-DEMON WHO WAS
FREED FROM HIS SEAL BY KAGOME.
I'll be the one to take you on!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:28.590
I'll be the one to take you on!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:37.580
Now, Master Inuyasha!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.760
MYOGA
A FLEA-DEMON VASSAL OF INUYASHA.
Now, Master Inuyasha!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.220
Use the Tetsusaiga
to break the barrier!
MYOGA
