00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:41.140
Yeah!
Use the Tetsusaiga
to break the barrier!

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:41.830
Yeah!

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.320
Now if you'll excuse me…!

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:54.890
KAGOME
A YOUNG GIRL WHO HAD TRAVELED
BACK IN TIME TO THE FEUDAL ERA.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.660
The barrier is dissipating.
KAGOME
A YOUNG GIRL WHO HAD TRAVELED
BACK IN TIME TO THE FEUDAL ERA.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.030
Leave it to Inuyasha!
KAGOME
A YOUNG GIRL WHO HAD TRAVELED
BACK IN TIME TO THE FEUDAL ERA.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:59.250
SHIPPO
A YOUNG FOX-DEMON WHO CAN USE FOX MAGIC.
Leave it to Inuyasha!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:05:59.960
SANGO
ONE OF THE LAST SURVIVORS
OF A TRIBE OF DEMON SLAYERS.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.520
Miroku, take the right!
SANGO
ONE OF THE LAST SURVIVORS
OF A TRIBE OF DEMON SLAYERS.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:01.670
MIROKU
A MONK CURSED WITH THE
WIND TUNNEL IN HIS RIGHT HAND.
Miroku, take the right!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.840
No problem!
MIROKU
A MONK CURSED WITH THE
WIND TUNNEL IN HIS RIGHT HAND.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.650
MIROKU
A MONK CURSED WITH THE
WIND TUNNEL IN HIS RIGHT HAND.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.080
KIRARA
SANGO'S TWIN-TAILED FELINE DEMON COMPANION.

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.440
Inuyasha!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.320
Kagome!
Where's the Sacred Jewel shard?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:28.570
On his back!

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:29.860
Okay!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.790
Take this!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.590
Damn it!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:54.680
Inuyasha!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:55.890
Watch out! Stay outta the way!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:57.810
What're you doing?!

00:06:58.680 --> 00:06:59.770
Inuyasha!

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.850
Become a part of my body.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.030
Inuyasha!

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.580
My sacred sutras have no effect.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:32.470
Get your…slimy body off of me!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.230
If you stay still,
you'll get caught again!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.440
I know that!

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:50.740
NARAKU
THE ARCH-ENEMY OF INUYASHA AND HIS COMPANIONS.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.350
It's the same no matter
how many times you try.
NARAKU
THE ARCH-ENEMY OF INUYASHA AND HIS COMPANIONS.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:52.990
It's the same no matter
how many times you try.

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.910
Shaddup! I'll cut you
into bits and pieces!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:57.790
Sango!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.300
Damn pests!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.300
Prepare to die, Naraku!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:14.090
Wind Scar!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.060
Go!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.500
KIKYO
RESURRECTED PRIESTESS WHO
ONCE PROTECTED THE SHIKON JEWEL.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:47.920
SESSHOMARU
IUNYASHA'S BROTHER WHO IS A FULL-FLEDGED DEMON.

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:56.840
KAGURA
AN INCARANATION OF NARAKU WHO CONTROLS THE WIND.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.290
My heart… It's returned?
KAGURA
AN INCARANATION OF NARAKU WHO CONTROLS THE WIND.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.510
My heart… It's returned?

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:00.870
Naraku…is dead.

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.970
KANNA
AN INCARNATION OF NARAKU
AND OLDER SISTER OF KAGURA.
Naraku…is dead.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:03.270
KANNA
AN INCARNATION OF NARAKU
AND OLDER SISTER OF KAGURA.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:06.980
KOHAKU
SANGO'S YOUNGER BROTHER
WHO IS UNDER NARAKU'S CONTROL.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.860
Sister?
KOHAKU
SANGO'S YOUNGER BROTHER
WHO IS UNDER NARAKU'S CONTROL.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:09.060
KOHAKU
SANGO'S YOUNGER BROTHER
WHO IS UNDER NARAKU'S CONTROL.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:15.860
Did we succeed?

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.780
Did we beat Naraku?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:36.970
What's wrong, Miroku?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.140
Shippo…

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:38.930
Huh?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:39.890
Look.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.680
Take a good look, Shippo.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.560
The Wind Tunnel is gone!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:10.290
Kanna, what're we looking
for in a place like this?

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:16.670
Kagura, what is it you wish?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.930
That's easy.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:23.560
Freedom. I'm the wind.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:27.390
Hey!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.980
Your wish will come true.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:36.940
Don't you understand?
I have my freedom now.

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.740
Thanks to Naraku dying.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.550
I'm at such a loss.
How do I get to Mount Fuji?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.220
It's so dark,
I don't have a clue.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:04.600
This feels so good.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.980
How long has it been since
we relaxed like this?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.820
Kagome…

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.570
Huh?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.990
What do you plan to do from now?

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.160
Me?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.990
Well, I still have to look
for the Sacred Jewel shards.

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:30.000
We didn't find the shard that
was in Naraku's possession.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:38.050
When all the shards are found…

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.760
…will my purpose here end?

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.020
Sango…

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:55.690
Huh?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.730
We have to look for Kohaku too.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.320
With Naraku dead,
I wonder how he's doing.

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.530
I'm sure he's fine.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.910
If we keep searching
for the Jewel shards,

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.740
we're sure to find Kohaku.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.910
Sango, we're all with you!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.880
Thank you.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:21.050
Ohhh! Celestial Maidens!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.970
Maidens from Heaven are bathing!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.510
You there…sir!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:26.100
Huh?!

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.350
Who is it?

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.100
What are you doing here?

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:30.770
Oww!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.690
Hey!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.730
It had to be you,
you lecherous monk!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.070
You have it wrong!

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:42.110
I was protecting
you two from danger!

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.070
The only protection we
need is against YOU!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.070
Wait, Sango! Don't be rash!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.830
What was that?!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.450
Inuyasha, sit!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.880
Thank goodness I was spared!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:13.560
A mirror?

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.890
To meet nevermore

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:20.230
Tears of sorrow overflow
deep within my heart

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:24.150
What good is this potion of
life, nothing matters now

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.920
So Naraku has died.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:50.010
Next, all living creatures
in this world will be erased.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.510
And perpetual night
shall be mine.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.140
Who are you?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.350
I am the Princess
of the Heavens…

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.060
Kaguya.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.170
That is the Dream Castle
of the pentacle mirrors.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:30.430
Kagura, your freedom is
but a fleeting illusion.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.470
Humph! So what of it?

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.190
I shall show you…
eternal freedom.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.770
I can grant your wish.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:51.450
Kanna, is this worth our time?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.590
To meet nevermore

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.760
Tears of sorrow overflow
deep within my heart

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:10.880
What good is this potion of
life, nothing matters now

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.640
This is the poem
composed by the Mikado.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.270
"I will never see
Princess Kaguya again."

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.310
"The tears of sadness overflow.
So

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.230
much that my body would float."

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.230
"What is the use of the
elixir of immortality?"

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.520
"I have no use for it now."

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.230
That is the meaning.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:31.240
The Mikado orders his vassals to
take the elixir of immortality

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.490
to Suruga where the
tallest mountain

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.240
in Japan stood, and burn it.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.410
At that time,
the mountain was called

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.580
mountain of
immortality, or Fushi

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.670
from which the name Mt.
Fuji is derived.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.250
That's all for today.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.340
Your reports on the "Tale of the

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.420
Bamboo Cutter" are
due next period.

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.340
Kagome… Class is over.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.260
Stand!

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.270
Bow!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.270
Homework, huh?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.980
What a drag.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.520
We're in middle school already!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:10.610
Why do we have to write a
report about a fairy tale?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.110
But, you know…

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.950
the famous author Murasaki
Shikibu wrote that

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.200
the "Tale of the
Bamboo Cutter" is

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.490
considered one of
the first novels.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.410
A classic's classic?

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.670
But wasn't this Princess
Kaguya pretty willful?

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.290
She sought suitors to marry,

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.340
then gave them
difficult tasks to

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.300
complete, then jilted them all.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.510
Even the Mikado!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.300
And ultimately,
she returns to the moon.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:37.550
That's right. Princess
Kaguya returned to the moon

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.220
and never came back.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:43.390
How long will I be able
to keep coming and going?

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.100
By the way…

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.650
Kagome, you have someone
wooing you with presents.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:49.400
Huh?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:53.110
I wonder what he'll
give you today.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.320
Hey! Kagome!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.700
Speaking of the devil…

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:03.290
You've been coming to
school a lot lately.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.120
Yes, thank goodness.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.630
Drink this and build
up your strength.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.050
Thank you.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.300
Say, are you free this Sunday?

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.350
Let's go to the amusement park.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.020
And this time,
don't cancel on me.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:24.730
Sis!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:26.810
Sis!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.360
Sota, what's the matter?

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.110
Inuyasha is…!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:30.610
Shh!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.360
Something wrong?

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.360
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.030
See you all later!

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.380
What about Inuyasha?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.420
He was at the house
until a little while ago…

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.170
but he's disappeared.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:58.430
Why weren't you watching him?!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:01.390
All dressed up in
that gaudy red outfit…

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.350
He's bound to attract attention!

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.810
But I couldn't help it…

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.150
Such noisy dogs! Sit!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:09.770
Huh?

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.400
Inuyasha! What are you…?

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.280
W-What do you mean, what?!
You're late…

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:21.120
– So I came for you! – Didja
hear about the mountain witch?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.120
Everyone's talking about her.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:26.290
– She's got long white hair.
– And horns too.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:29.380
– I heard it was a man.
– The man took the boy's candy.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.750
Huh? I thought the girl was
gonna give him chocolate.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:33.340
So what's the problem?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.380
I want to spend time here!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:36.590
We ain't got time!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.470
We have to find the
Sacred Jewel shards!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:44.260
Besides, it's all your fault
the Shikon Jewel was shattered!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.430
– I know that!
– No, you don't!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.810
Keep talking and…

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.730
– I'll never go back again!
– Boy, they're always fighting.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.980
When all the shards
are collected,

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.320
you can come back anytime!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:57.110
You sure talk big. You
can't do a thing without me!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.070
That's not true!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.450
It is so true!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.450
You can see for yourself
how foolish you look.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.540
What did you say?!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.000
What was that?!
Kagome, stand back!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.460
What the…?! Why you!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.920
Iron Reaver Soul…

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:12.920
Stop it!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.130
– Sis, you're really creating a scene.
– Sit, boy!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.490
Not yet?

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.450
So, that's the Crystal
from the Dragon's Neck?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.730
I see…

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:21.030
This demonic aura which
replaced Naraku's…

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:22.610
I will discover whose it is.

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.160
FIVE LAKES OF FUJI, LAKE YAMANAKA

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:37.800
Oh, arrow of mine

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:41.090
With power pure and
immense to slay the dragon

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:42.630
Do your good deed
fast and swift,

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:43.630
grasp the crystal in its neck

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:51.930
FIVE LAKES OF FUJI, LAKE SHOJI

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.100
I ventured to see

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.560
if what I had heard was
true But this jeweled sprig

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.650
with leaves so real, 'twas but
nothing more than empty words

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.030
Three more.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.290
Which one next?

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:13.080
Cloth woven from the fur
of the Fire-rat… Inuyasha.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.040
Got it.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:21.550
What're you doing?

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:25.720
Well, we have pictures
of us together. So…

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:31.430
All done.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:35.890
Here.

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:37.150
What's this?

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.320
Keep it on you at all times.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:40.980
For what?

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.200
Well… It'll grant your wishes.

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:45.990
Huh?

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:49.120
Yes, it works much better
than the Sacred Jewel.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.200
You liar!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.040
I wouldn't wear such
stuff even if I'm dead.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.540
What's wrong with it?!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.620
You can't do a thing without me!

00:21:58.790 --> 00:21:59.790
What?!

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:01.050
What's wrong?

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:03.840
Inuyasha?

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:06.220
This scent… It couldn't be…

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:07.970
What is it, all of the sudden?

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:12.100
I'm sure of it!
It's Naraku's scent!

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:14.480
He's still alive!

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:35.660
So you came.

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.250
It's you, Kagura!

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:41.210
You here to avenge Naraku?

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:44.590
Naraku? That's right…
There was such a guy.

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:47.880
Well, he's out of my life now.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.680
Then what're you doing here?!

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:53.680
Inuyasha!

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:55.600
Dance of Blades!

00:22:58.690 --> 00:22:59.440
Kagura!

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:00.770
Dance of the Dragon!

00:23:05.150 --> 00:23:05.900
Damn!

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:13.580
Inuyasha!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.450
Stay back!

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:24.340
I've got it… the
Robe of the Fire-rat.

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:25.750
What—?!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:31.010
A full moon?

00:23:38.730 --> 00:23:40.100
The limitless heat

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:42.730
of my love for you cannot
burn this cloth of fur

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:46.320
My raiment sleeves dried of
tears Now on this day I don it

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:53.870
What's that?!

00:23:58.120 --> 00:23:59.750
Who are you?!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:01.790
My name is Kaguya…

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:05.340
I am the ruler of
Perpetual Night.

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:07.380
Kaguya?

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:12.890
Whaddya want with me?!

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:13.760
Inuyasha!

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:14.680
Stay back!

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:17.930
She's…dangerous!

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:21.770
I can see…

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:23.980
your inner desire.

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:28.780
Your true self… where
your dark heart rules…

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:31.030
A despicable beast!

00:24:33.860 --> 00:24:35.410
Quit babbling!

00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:37.160
C'mon outta there!

00:24:37.790 --> 00:24:39.450
Wind Scar!

00:24:47.960 --> 00:24:48.750
What?!

00:24:53.380 --> 00:24:54.470
Is that how it is?

00:24:54.640 --> 00:24:56.800
Then I'll just
destroy the mirror!

00:24:59.520 --> 00:25:00.680
Dance of the Dragon!

00:25:00.810 --> 00:25:02.480
Backlash Wave!

00:25:05.940 --> 00:25:06.770
What?!

00:25:09.020 --> 00:25:09.730
Kanna!

00:25:10.780 --> 00:25:11.570
The fool!

00:25:17.120 --> 00:25:17.870
What's that?!

00:25:41.220 --> 00:25:41.970
Sit!

00:25:48.860 --> 00:25:51.610
Inuyasha, how you've fallen…

00:25:51.730 --> 00:25:53.610
needing the protection
of a mere girl.

00:26:05.870 --> 00:26:07.120
Inuyasha!

00:26:13.550 --> 00:26:14.880
Inuyasha!

00:26:18.180 --> 00:26:19.300
Inuyasha!

00:26:20.680 --> 00:26:21.390
Inuyasha!

00:26:21.760 --> 00:26:22.430
Inuyasha!

00:26:24.390 --> 00:26:25.850
Inuyasha, are you all right?!

00:26:26.890 --> 00:26:27.980
That girl…

00:26:28.690 --> 00:26:30.940
Only she seems to have a
different flow of time.

00:26:32.360 --> 00:26:33.900
Is it okay to let them go?

00:26:34.360 --> 00:26:36.150
I have what I wanted.

00:26:42.790 --> 00:26:44.620
FIVE LAKES OF FUJI, LAKE MOTOSU

00:26:50.670 --> 00:26:51.960
Could you have but known

00:26:52.290 --> 00:26:54.420
that it would burn so
swiftly this raiment of fur

00:26:55.010 --> 00:26:57.930
You would not then have sat
with such little show of concern

00:27:27.910 --> 00:27:30.080
So you defeated Naraku?

00:27:31.960 --> 00:27:32.750
Yes.

00:27:32.790 --> 00:27:36.590
Your late father and
grandfather must be truly happy.

00:27:37.970 --> 00:27:39.220
I hope so.

00:27:40.090 --> 00:27:43.970
And what will you do from now?

00:27:44.640 --> 00:27:46.970
Now that I've defeated
my arch-enemy,

00:27:47.220 --> 00:27:50.690
there is only one more
duty that awaits me.

00:27:51.190 --> 00:27:54.570
To ease the hearts of the
beauties throughout this country

00:27:54.570 --> 00:27:56.320
and with body and mind.

00:28:03.120 --> 00:28:05.080
I guess Sango wouldn't be here.

00:28:05.280 --> 00:28:06.160
What's wrong?

00:28:06.700 --> 00:28:07.750
Um…

00:28:08.000 --> 00:28:09.250
As a man…

00:28:09.710 --> 00:28:13.250
will I never get over this fear?

00:28:15.090 --> 00:28:17.670
Well, well… Let me
read your palm then.

00:28:19.010 --> 00:28:20.010
Hmm…

00:28:22.300 --> 00:28:23.140
What's this?

00:28:24.010 --> 00:28:27.260
You…have only three
more days to live.

00:28:28.020 --> 00:28:29.180
Three days?!

00:28:30.020 --> 00:28:32.850
No, no… I jest.

00:28:34.060 --> 00:28:36.020
By the way, Miroku…

00:28:36.440 --> 00:28:39.570
Your grandfather,
the monk Miyatsu,

00:28:39.570 --> 00:28:41.780
left this last testament.

00:28:46.620 --> 00:28:48.450
I was instructed
to give it to his

00:28:48.490 --> 00:28:50.160
descendant who defeated Naraku.

00:29:17.270 --> 00:29:19.610
I wonder what everyone's doing?

00:29:22.070 --> 00:29:24.070
Yes, let's hurry home.

00:29:26.200 --> 00:29:27.160
What's wrong, Kirara?

00:29:28.580 --> 00:29:29.410
Kirara!

00:29:40.090 --> 00:29:40.880
Hand it over!

00:29:40.920 --> 00:29:42.760
Give us the Sacred Jewel shard!

00:30:08.070 --> 00:30:09.740
Looks so tender!

00:30:09.780 --> 00:30:11.160
His thigh is mine!

00:30:11.200 --> 00:30:12.330
I'll have his eyeballs.

00:30:21.920 --> 00:30:22.630
Kohaku!

00:30:57.920 --> 00:30:58.830
Priestess…

00:31:02.540 --> 00:31:03.840
What happened here?

00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:07.720
Demons came and the
villagers were all…

00:31:08.180 --> 00:31:09.180
Demons?

00:31:10.300 --> 00:31:11.300
The head monk…

00:31:12.390 --> 00:31:14.890
entrusted me with this.

00:31:19.190 --> 00:31:21.150
The Stone Bowl of Buddha.

00:31:22.310 --> 00:31:23.400
The demons…

00:31:24.190 --> 00:31:25.190
were after this.

00:31:25.780 --> 00:31:27.650
Are you sure you want
to give it to me?

00:31:28.700 --> 00:31:31.200
I could also be a demon.

00:31:33.780 --> 00:31:35.200
You do not…

00:31:35.580 --> 00:31:38.370
look like…a bad person.

00:31:56.350 --> 00:31:57.520
Hey, Inuyasha…

00:31:57.730 --> 00:31:59.480
Are we going without
Miroku and Sango?

00:32:00.940 --> 00:32:03.110
In which direction do you
sense the Jewel shard?

00:32:03.400 --> 00:32:04.690
Inuyasha…

00:32:05.150 --> 00:32:07.230
You're not fully healed.

00:32:07.230 --> 00:32:08.940
Quit talking and point!

00:32:09.240 --> 00:32:10.820
Hey, Inuyasha…

00:32:11.200 --> 00:32:14.580
I think you're upset
'cuz you lost to Kagura.

00:32:14.700 --> 00:32:16.370
Just keep your mouth shut!

00:32:16.870 --> 00:32:19.250
You are! You are upset!

00:32:20.410 --> 00:32:22.670
I said to keep quiet!

00:32:24.790 --> 00:32:28.210
– I knew it! You are upset!
– Inuyasha!

00:32:29.260 --> 00:32:30.260
What do you want?

00:32:30.260 --> 00:32:32.130
Do I hafta spell it out?!

00:32:32.130 --> 00:32:34.390
Leave all your
belongings and go!

00:32:34.550 --> 00:32:37.310
I am on an important mission.

00:32:37.310 --> 00:32:38.890
Can't you rob someone else?

00:32:39.180 --> 00:32:40.270
After we're done with you!

00:32:40.270 --> 00:32:41.140
Out of my way!

00:32:45.020 --> 00:32:46.230
Hold it!

00:32:46.610 --> 00:32:49.990
Passing through without
even a "By your leave"?!

00:32:50.150 --> 00:32:51.280
Hey, that's not wise.

00:32:51.280 --> 00:32:52.820
Inuyasha is in a bad mood today.

00:32:52.860 --> 00:32:54.950
Huh? Don't make me laugh!

00:32:54.990 --> 00:32:57.490
We're mad as hell too!

00:32:57.740 --> 00:33:00.540
This is my last warning.
Better apologize now.

00:33:00.580 --> 00:33:01.460
Too late!

00:33:01.460 --> 00:33:02.290
Why you—!

00:33:03.250 --> 00:33:04.710
Now you'll get it!

00:33:13.430 --> 00:33:15.300
I thank you for
coming to my rescue.

00:33:17.640 --> 00:33:18.760
I am truly in your debt.

00:33:18.760 --> 00:33:19.430
Huh?!

00:33:21.310 --> 00:33:22.430
Hojo?!

00:33:22.770 --> 00:33:23.310
Huh?

00:33:24.770 --> 00:33:27.440
Yes, Hojo is my name.
Akitoki Hojo.

00:33:28.070 --> 00:33:30.730
Could he be an ancestor?

00:33:31.780 --> 00:33:34.950
This is just a token of
my appreciation, but here…

00:33:35.490 --> 00:33:36.320
Thank you.

00:33:37.280 --> 00:33:39.580
It's good for you.
Please eat it.

00:33:39.950 --> 00:33:41.290
He has to be an ancestor.

00:33:42.620 --> 00:33:43.500
How about one…

00:33:45.290 --> 00:33:46.330
My oranges!

00:33:48.710 --> 00:33:49.340
Huh?

00:33:52.340 --> 00:33:53.970
This is beautiful. What is it?

00:33:54.800 --> 00:33:56.050
Our precious family treasure.

00:33:56.340 --> 00:33:58.050
What do you mean?

00:33:58.680 --> 00:34:01.850
It's the Hojo heirloom…
the Celestial Robe.

00:34:04.350 --> 00:34:06.690
Celestial Robe?
As in the famous one?

00:34:07.150 --> 00:34:07.770
Exactly.

00:34:08.360 --> 00:34:11.610
I am in a hurry,
so please excuse me.

00:34:15.110 --> 00:34:15.740
Oww!

00:34:17.360 --> 00:34:20.370
What a guy! He won't
survive in these times.

00:34:23.000 --> 00:34:24.080
Help yourself.

00:34:24.370 --> 00:34:25.710
Thanks!

00:34:26.540 --> 00:34:28.920
Lately,
the full moon has not waned.

00:34:28.920 --> 00:34:30.290
Don't I know it.

00:34:30.290 --> 00:34:32.590
My comrades have been
up partying every night.

00:34:33.380 --> 00:34:36.300
Actually, this phenomenon
occurred fifty years ago too.

00:34:36.630 --> 00:34:37.930
Fifty years ago?

00:34:38.640 --> 00:34:41.640
My grandfather, Head Monk
Miyatsu, put under seal,

00:34:41.680 --> 00:34:43.560
an evil demon
which made the full

00:34:43.600 --> 00:34:45.310
moon appear night after night.

00:34:45.850 --> 00:34:48.480
Evil? You mean, Naraku?

00:34:48.520 --> 00:34:49.810
He is dead.

00:34:51.770 --> 00:34:56.570
Which means…the Wind Tunnel
in your right palm is gone?

00:34:57.400 --> 00:34:58.740
Yes. It is.

00:35:01.740 --> 00:35:03.240
And so, Hachi…

00:35:04.200 --> 00:35:05.790
I've been thinking
about going to see it.

00:35:11.750 --> 00:35:14.420
Is that why you summoned me?

00:35:15.630 --> 00:35:18.630
No one minds if there's
a full moon every night.

00:35:19.550 --> 00:35:22.180
Grandfather Miyatsu
wrote this in his will…

00:35:23.430 --> 00:35:26.390
She stops time with
her undisturbed mind

00:35:26.560 --> 00:35:29.270
and destroys all living beings.

00:35:30.400 --> 00:35:33.440
You will come with
me, won't you, Hachi?

00:35:33.480 --> 00:35:37.440
Hey, Miroku… Will this
raccoon-dog be of any use?

00:35:38.030 --> 00:35:39.320
Rest assured.

00:35:39.450 --> 00:35:41.990
Hachi has
unquestionable loyalty.

00:35:43.620 --> 00:35:46.330
Hah! As if!

00:35:46.450 --> 00:35:49.420
Who'd take on such
a dangerous job?

00:35:50.460 --> 00:35:52.840
So you will not heed my request?

00:35:52.840 --> 00:35:56.460
Hah! Without your Wind
Tunnel, who's scared of you?!

00:36:00.470 --> 00:36:02.640
Let's take a short walk
and talk, shall we?

00:36:03.100 --> 00:36:05.180
We'll be right back.

00:36:05.350 --> 00:36:07.470
Yes… Go easy now.

00:36:07.730 --> 00:36:09.480
What's the matter? Come.

00:36:12.480 --> 00:36:14.440
Poor thing.

00:36:14.610 --> 00:36:15.940
Now listen up!

00:36:16.150 --> 00:36:18.780
I've been real good to you!

00:36:20.490 --> 00:36:22.780
Hachi has kindly
agreed to accompany me.

00:36:23.450 --> 00:36:25.910
Well then, be
careful, both of you.

00:36:26.160 --> 00:36:26.660
Yes!

00:36:27.490 --> 00:36:30.500
Yes, sir… I'll go wherever
you tell me to go.

00:36:50.140 --> 00:36:51.600
A full moon again.

00:36:52.520 --> 00:36:54.270
What's happening?

00:37:12.410 --> 00:37:13.120
Huh?

00:37:14.040 --> 00:37:14.790
What's this…?

00:37:19.380 --> 00:37:20.300
Kohaku?

00:37:25.430 --> 00:37:26.890
You feel well enough to get up?

00:37:31.810 --> 00:37:32.600
Where are we?

00:37:32.980 --> 00:37:36.310
The village of the Demon
Slayers. Our homeland.

00:37:37.190 --> 00:37:38.110
Homeland?

00:37:40.570 --> 00:37:45.410
I see. You still don't
remember everything, do you?

00:37:46.410 --> 00:37:47.700
I'm sorry, Miss Sango.

00:37:52.160 --> 00:37:53.830
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:38:06.890 --> 00:38:08.800
Naraku is dead…

00:38:10.810 --> 00:38:13.270
Yet you're still not
free, are you?

00:38:16.690 --> 00:38:20.610
Free from the painful memory of
killing Father and the others…

00:38:44.630 --> 00:38:45.630
Sister…

00:38:47.510 --> 00:38:48.470
Kohaku?

00:38:49.140 --> 00:38:50.220
What did you just call me…?

00:38:50.260 --> 00:38:54.680
That's the only word that
I recall… once in a while.

00:38:56.600 --> 00:38:57.480
But…

00:38:58.020 --> 00:38:59.810
Then I feel the pain.

00:39:01.020 --> 00:39:02.730
Like my heart is being crushed.

00:39:05.110 --> 00:39:07.660
It's okay, don't try too hard.

00:39:08.910 --> 00:39:12.080
Take your time and remember.

00:39:24.960 --> 00:39:25.760
Kirara?

00:39:32.970 --> 00:39:33.720
Kagura!

00:39:37.350 --> 00:39:40.400
You're not here to
take Kohaku back?

00:39:41.480 --> 00:39:45.070
All I want is the Swallow's
Cowrie Shell which he possesses.

00:39:45.690 --> 00:39:48.110
We were both freed from Naraku.

00:39:48.150 --> 00:39:49.820
So let's be friends, okay?

00:39:52.200 --> 00:39:55.290
Hand it over quietly
and you'll live.

00:39:56.700 --> 00:39:57.830
Kohaku, get the Hiraikotsu.

00:39:57.870 --> 00:39:58.660
'Kay!

00:39:59.080 --> 00:40:00.500
Dance of the Dragon!

00:40:02.460 --> 00:40:03.540
– Here it is… – Get inside!

00:40:12.140 --> 00:40:13.260
Kohaku!

00:40:18.310 --> 00:40:19.730
I'm taking this!

00:40:35.530 --> 00:40:36.740
How is your leg?

00:40:37.620 --> 00:40:39.750
Never mind me… But the
Swallow's Cowrie Shell…

00:40:40.370 --> 00:40:41.750
Just what is that?

00:40:43.040 --> 00:40:45.790
If that gets into their hands…

00:40:46.170 --> 00:40:47.130
Then what?

00:40:47.840 --> 00:40:49.550
The seal will be broken.

00:40:57.680 --> 00:40:59.060
Master Miroku…

00:41:01.060 --> 00:41:03.190
Is this grave…

00:41:03.770 --> 00:41:07.780
Yes, it has to be the grave of
my grandfather, Monk Miyatsu.

00:41:08.110 --> 00:41:09.780
Excuse me…

00:41:12.780 --> 00:41:15.780
Did you know Master Miyatsu?

00:41:20.560 --> 00:41:22.960
FIVE LAKES OF FUJI, LAKE SAI

00:41:26.460 --> 00:41:27.750
Time has swiftly passed

00:41:28.050 --> 00:41:30.510
As I have waited to see
this shell you promised

00:41:30.880 --> 00:41:33.840
They say that I wait in vain
Now could this be truly so?

00:41:37.810 --> 00:41:39.310
Just one more…

00:41:39.770 --> 00:41:41.810
The Stone Bowl of Buddha…

00:41:54.530 --> 00:41:56.660
I wonder if there will be
another full moon tonight.

00:41:59.280 --> 00:42:02.200
That would work
out fine with me!

00:42:06.330 --> 00:42:09.840
Great! I've never
tasted anything so good.

00:42:09.960 --> 00:42:12.840
Where are you headed, Hojo?

00:42:13.340 --> 00:42:16.550
I cannot reveal
that to strangers.

00:42:19.220 --> 00:42:21.850
Actually,
I am on my way to Mount Fuji

00:42:22.020 --> 00:42:24.640
to throw the robe
into the crater.

00:42:25.850 --> 00:42:26.850
Robe?

00:42:27.480 --> 00:42:29.860
You mean the Celestial Robe?

00:42:30.020 --> 00:42:30.860
Exactly.

00:42:32.280 --> 00:42:35.860
The robe was entrusted to the
Hojo family generations ago.

00:42:36.450 --> 00:42:39.830
It belonged to an
immortal celestial being.

00:42:40.280 --> 00:42:43.580
And our family has cherished
it as our treasure.

00:42:43.870 --> 00:42:48.540
But one day, a very high-ranking
monk came with this warning…

00:42:49.460 --> 00:42:52.880
When the bright full moon
continues for many nights,

00:42:53.130 --> 00:42:54.720
throw the robe into the mouth of

00:42:54.720 --> 00:42:56.380
Mount Fuji crater
and let it burn.

00:42:56.880 --> 00:43:00.470
Otherwise, great calamity
will fall upon the land.

00:43:02.180 --> 00:43:05.890
And these several nights,
the full moon has continued.

00:43:06.600 --> 00:43:08.900
The monk's prediction
has come true.

00:43:09.150 --> 00:43:12.020
The robe must be destroyed
as soon as possible.

00:43:12.230 --> 00:43:13.940
Hah! The story stinks!

00:43:14.400 --> 00:43:17.110
If what the monk said is
true, what

00:43:17.110 --> 00:43:19.620
kind of calamity's gonna happen?

00:43:19.910 --> 00:43:21.950
Well, I don't know… Oh!

00:43:24.040 --> 00:43:26.870
The moon…and a celestial robe…

00:43:26.910 --> 00:43:28.170
That's the story
of Princess Kaguya.

00:43:28.830 --> 00:43:31.460
Under the full moon,
celestial maidens

00:43:31.500 --> 00:43:33.630
came for her and put on a robe…

00:43:33.670 --> 00:43:35.050
What? Kaguya?

00:43:35.630 --> 00:43:40.050
She did reek of disaster…

00:43:54.020 --> 00:43:56.940
A dead priestess who lives
off the souls of the dead…

00:43:57.440 --> 00:43:59.490
You always look so gloomy.

00:44:06.750 --> 00:44:10.040
Answer me… Is this
all Naraku's doing?

00:44:11.670 --> 00:44:14.920
Still concerned about
a dead guy like that?

00:44:15.960 --> 00:44:17.010
Dead?

00:44:28.560 --> 00:44:29.480
What's the matter?

00:44:30.980 --> 00:44:34.610
Won't you accept it?
It's what you seek.

00:44:37.990 --> 00:44:39.570
You're awfully
nonchalant about this.

00:44:40.990 --> 00:44:43.070
I'm not like you.

00:44:59.760 --> 00:45:03.010
Geez, you're a creepy woman.

00:45:03.760 --> 00:45:07.890
But well, this is the
last of it. I owe you.

00:45:17.270 --> 00:45:18.730
There is a frightening saying

00:45:18.730 --> 00:45:21.990
that has been passed
down in this village.

00:45:22.910 --> 00:45:25.160
One day, a celestial maiden was

00:45:25.160 --> 00:45:27.700
bathing in a spring
by the village.

00:45:28.040 --> 00:45:31.120
A man who saw her stole
the Celestial Robe

00:45:31.160 --> 00:45:33.960
that was hanging
on a tree branch.

00:45:34.420 --> 00:45:37.000
I know that story!

00:45:37.040 --> 00:45:38.670
The man who stole
the robe and the

00:45:38.670 --> 00:45:40.130
celestial maiden were married.

00:45:41.050 --> 00:45:43.970
The story in the
village is different…

00:45:44.220 --> 00:45:47.970
The heavenly being whose robe
was stolen became mad with fury

00:45:48.010 --> 00:45:52.060
and slew innocent villagers
one after another.

00:45:56.520 --> 00:46:00.070
By a stroke of luck, Monk
Miyatsu came upon this village

00:46:00.070 --> 00:46:02.360
and sealed the maiden inside a

00:46:02.360 --> 00:46:05.030
mirror known as
the Mirror of Life.

00:46:05.240 --> 00:46:08.080
Was she really a
celestial being?

00:46:08.580 --> 00:46:10.950
Or a demon disguised as one?

00:46:11.660 --> 00:46:17.210
But I've heard that the robe
stolen by the man was real.

00:46:17.750 --> 00:46:22.090
Does this Celestial Robe
still exist in this village?

00:46:23.090 --> 00:46:26.300
No… No one knows
where it is now.

00:46:27.090 --> 00:46:28.640
What about this Mirror of Life

00:46:28.640 --> 00:46:30.430
inside which the
maiden was sealed?

00:46:31.180 --> 00:46:35.480
It was placed on the
altar with a divine sprig.

00:46:36.060 --> 00:46:39.940
In the Forest of Ilusion in the
Shrine of the Mirror of Life.

00:46:42.110 --> 00:46:44.530
FIVE LAKES OF FUJI, LAKE KAWAGUCHI

00:46:54.830 --> 00:46:56.250
I hoped there would be

00:46:56.620 --> 00:46:59.130
the glow of the fallen
dew- But nothing I can see

00:46:59.540 --> 00:47:02.800
So why did you go yonder
to the Mount of Ogura

00:47:31.870 --> 00:47:35.040
The moon seen through a physical
body is truly beautiful.

00:47:35.540 --> 00:47:36.830
You promised.

00:47:37.120 --> 00:47:40.210
So let me have
this true freedom.

00:47:40.670 --> 00:47:42.090
– No…
– Huh?

00:47:43.590 --> 00:47:47.170
There is one more thing I need.

00:47:56.230 --> 00:47:57.520
Look…

00:47:57.980 --> 00:47:59.900
Princess Kaguya made all her

00:47:59.940 --> 00:48:02.190
suitors undertake
rigorous tasks.

00:48:03.020 --> 00:48:04.860
And there's mention of
cloth from a fire-rat.

00:48:04.860 --> 00:48:05.480
Huh?

00:48:05.650 --> 00:48:06.400
See…

00:48:06.650 --> 00:48:08.200
The Jeweled Sprig of Horai,

00:48:08.490 --> 00:48:09.860
the Crystal from
the Dragon's Neck,

00:48:10.110 --> 00:48:11.660
the Stone Bowl of Buddha,

00:48:11.660 --> 00:48:12.950
the Swallow's Cowrie Shell,

00:48:12.990 --> 00:48:14.990
and the Robe of the Fire-rat.

00:48:15.490 --> 00:48:19.460
That's why Kaguya came
after your kimono.

00:48:20.830 --> 00:48:22.500
Nice cozy twosome, huh?

00:48:23.210 --> 00:48:25.300
Unrequited love…

00:48:25.300 --> 00:48:28.720
What?
You're in love with Kagome?

00:48:29.220 --> 00:48:32.640
When I first glimpsed Miss
Kagome through the steamy mist…

00:48:33.050 --> 00:48:35.220
I thought it was a
celestial being from heaven.

00:48:36.350 --> 00:48:37.310
Hmm…

00:48:37.680 --> 00:48:40.020
So you were the peeping Tom!

00:48:40.940 --> 00:48:43.230
Hush! Don't ever say that aloud!

00:48:44.440 --> 00:48:46.980
Then you will be my
servant from this instant!

00:48:47.690 --> 00:48:48.240
Huh?

00:48:54.660 --> 00:48:55.370
Say…

00:48:56.240 --> 00:48:58.580
Maybe this Princess
Kaguya in the legend

00:48:58.790 --> 00:49:01.790
didn't really want to
return to the moon.

00:49:01.830 --> 00:49:03.250
Huh? What're you talking about?

00:49:03.290 --> 00:49:04.590
A shooting star!

00:49:05.090 --> 00:49:06.250
Make a wish!

00:49:16.890 --> 00:49:17.930
Inuyasha…

00:49:18.270 --> 00:49:19.100
Huh?

00:49:19.600 --> 00:49:22.350
Do you still want to
become a full demon?

00:49:22.730 --> 00:49:24.270
'Course!

00:49:24.610 --> 00:49:26.860
You're awfully strong already.

00:49:27.070 --> 00:49:28.820
Hah! Be quiet, will ya!

00:49:29.360 --> 00:49:32.990
I made up my mind to
become a full demon.

00:49:33.280 --> 00:49:35.280
So don't say anything more.

00:49:37.950 --> 00:49:40.870
But…I've been thinking…

00:49:41.330 --> 00:49:43.540
there's nothing wrong…

00:49:44.290 --> 00:49:46.340
with you remaining a half-demon.

00:49:48.960 --> 00:49:51.300
I like you just the way you are.

00:49:52.630 --> 00:49:53.590
Ridiculous!

00:49:54.300 --> 00:49:56.180
What do you mean ridiculous?!

00:49:56.220 --> 00:49:58.180
Can't you be a little serious?

00:50:05.560 --> 00:50:06.650
What?

00:50:07.060 --> 00:50:09.360
Inuyasha… You…

00:50:09.360 --> 00:50:10.530
So what?

00:50:14.610 --> 00:50:15.530
What's this?

00:50:16.320 --> 00:50:18.700
How strange… cherry blossoms
at this time of year?

00:50:20.330 --> 00:50:21.370
What's happening?

00:50:32.420 --> 00:50:33.800
The time has now come

00:50:34.130 --> 00:50:36.340
Behold the robe from
heaven to drape upon me

00:50:37.140 --> 00:50:39.680
And for you, it is only this
deep sadness that I feel

00:50:43.350 --> 00:50:46.650
Thanks for saving me the
trouble of going to you.

00:50:49.060 --> 00:50:50.860
Not you again?

00:50:51.360 --> 00:50:54.490
What luck I have to
come across such fools.

00:50:55.490 --> 00:50:57.410
Where is the Celestial Robe?

00:50:58.120 --> 00:50:59.370
Celestial Robe?

00:51:00.370 --> 00:51:01.410
There?

00:51:02.370 --> 00:51:04.370
No way!

00:51:13.920 --> 00:51:14.670
What?!

00:51:15.380 --> 00:51:16.760
Do not interfere!

00:51:26.350 --> 00:51:27.310
Inuyasha!

00:51:27.850 --> 00:51:29.100
W-What's…?!

00:51:30.860 --> 00:51:32.400
No wonder you're so weak.

00:51:32.860 --> 00:51:35.280
You're just a half-demon.

00:51:35.320 --> 00:51:36.990
So what of it?!

00:51:38.820 --> 00:51:39.490
Inuyasha!

00:51:43.580 --> 00:51:44.790
– Kagome!
– Inuyasha!

00:51:49.580 --> 00:51:53.500
Yes…that is it!
The Celestial Robe!

00:51:57.220 --> 00:51:58.430
Run, you fool!

00:51:58.430 --> 00:51:59.180
Huh?

00:52:02.390 --> 00:52:03.310
Kaguya!

00:52:04.640 --> 00:52:05.430
Of all the impudence…!

00:52:08.270 --> 00:52:09.440
A sacred arrow?

00:52:11.440 --> 00:52:12.440
Interesting…

00:52:13.440 --> 00:52:15.190
Release Inuyasha!

00:52:15.440 --> 00:52:16.900
Fool! Stay back!

00:52:18.450 --> 00:52:20.030
Just try it.

00:52:20.070 --> 00:52:21.450
You dare me?

00:52:37.510 --> 00:52:38.470
Inuyasha!

00:52:39.260 --> 00:52:40.010
Kagome!

00:52:40.300 --> 00:52:41.260
Watch out!

00:52:52.900 --> 00:52:54.190
Kagome…

00:52:57.360 --> 00:52:59.450
Kagome!

00:53:03.070 --> 00:53:06.830
I'm so glad,
Inuyasha… you're all right.

00:53:07.160 --> 00:53:10.370
Stupid! Why'd you do a
foolish thing like that?

00:53:11.370 --> 00:53:16.500
You're always doing
the same for me…

00:53:18.010 --> 00:53:20.130
Kagome!

00:53:20.170 --> 00:53:21.130
Kagome!

00:53:21.300 --> 00:53:22.800
Kagome!

00:53:24.510 --> 00:53:27.140
Damn! Lemme go!

00:53:27.510 --> 00:53:31.020
If Kagome dies,
you're gonna pay!

00:53:31.520 --> 00:53:35.310
Rest assured.
I won't let her die so easily.

00:53:36.020 --> 00:53:39.110
Tell me,
will you become my servant?

00:53:39.570 --> 00:53:42.530
Then I shall grant your wish.

00:53:45.530 --> 00:53:48.540
Go to hell! Release me now!

00:53:50.370 --> 00:53:52.540
I'm taking the girl.

00:53:54.750 --> 00:53:55.790
Wait!

00:53:56.380 --> 00:53:57.800
Where're you taking Kagome?!

00:54:01.380 --> 00:54:05.180
If you have the will,
come to my Dream Castle.

00:54:08.930 --> 00:54:11.100
Are you running away?!

00:54:17.110 --> 00:54:17.690
Damn!

00:54:22.490 --> 00:54:23.110
Hey!

00:54:23.280 --> 00:54:25.200
Where's this Dream Castle?!

00:54:26.200 --> 00:54:28.030
How should I know?!

00:54:28.450 --> 00:54:28.990
Umm…

00:54:29.870 --> 00:54:33.790
There's a saying taught to
my family by a certain monk.

00:54:34.580 --> 00:54:36.250
The Castle of the
Celestial Being

00:54:36.250 --> 00:54:37.630
lies in the Lake of Motosu…

00:54:37.630 --> 00:54:40.090
unreachable by mortals.

00:54:44.840 --> 00:54:46.090
Say, Hachi…

00:54:46.390 --> 00:54:49.600
Why didn't my grandfather
use his Wind Tunnel?

00:54:50.510 --> 00:54:52.270
Isn't it obvious?

00:54:52.270 --> 00:54:54.230
We're talking about
your grandfather.

00:54:54.230 --> 00:54:57.560
This celestial maiden was
probably a real beauty.

00:55:00.270 --> 00:55:04.150
Kaguya… I can't
wait to meet her.

00:55:04.900 --> 00:55:07.240
You never get tired of
it, do you?

00:55:15.660 --> 00:55:18.290
Is this the cave of the shrine?

00:55:18.630 --> 00:55:19.250
Shh!

00:55:19.630 --> 00:55:20.630
Huh?

00:55:22.340 --> 00:55:23.800
Someone got here first.

00:55:34.350 --> 00:55:35.140
Don't move!

00:55:43.650 --> 00:55:45.650
Please… Please wait!

00:55:47.660 --> 00:55:48.660
Miroku?

00:55:49.700 --> 00:55:50.990
Why're you here?!

00:55:51.620 --> 00:55:52.740
Sango…

00:55:54.080 --> 00:55:55.410
I longed to see you!

00:55:56.080 --> 00:55:57.790
H-Hey, Miroku!

00:55:57.830 --> 00:55:59.210
What're you doing?!

00:56:03.380 --> 00:56:05.960
Stop it! Let go!

00:56:08.680 --> 00:56:11.890
Oh, how my hands
remember this feeling.

00:56:14.600 --> 00:56:17.270
And oh,
how I remember this pain.

00:56:17.770 --> 00:56:20.060
It's been a long time, Sango.

00:56:20.480 --> 00:56:22.730
You haven't changed a bit, Monk!

00:56:23.900 --> 00:56:25.190
You know how it is…

00:56:31.070 --> 00:56:33.370
I'm glad Kohaku is alive.

00:56:33.700 --> 00:56:36.080
Yes, but his memory
is still blurred.

00:56:37.830 --> 00:56:38.710
Gone…

00:56:39.710 --> 00:56:43.460
The mirror as well
as the Jeweled Sprig.

00:56:43.710 --> 00:56:47.720
And Kagura stole the
Swallow's Cowrie Shell.

00:56:48.510 --> 00:56:50.880
This poses a serious problem.

00:56:52.140 --> 00:56:53.180
Master Miroku…

00:56:53.180 --> 00:56:57.730
So this cowrie thing was also
necessary to break the seal?

00:56:58.140 --> 00:57:00.810
Yes, the five treasures taken by

00:57:00.810 --> 00:57:03.730
Kaguya represent
the five elements:

00:57:03.730 --> 00:57:06.570
wood, fire, earth,
metal and water.

00:57:07.230 --> 00:57:10.280
This cloth of the Fire-rat…

00:57:10.650 --> 00:57:13.740
Could it be the same cloth
as Inuyasha's raiment?

00:57:14.370 --> 00:57:18.330
If so, we'll probably
meet up with him.

00:57:26.170 --> 00:57:27.880
A castle in the lake!

00:57:29.970 --> 00:57:31.930
What an immense demonic aura!

00:57:36.260 --> 00:57:37.640
Time and the full moon

00:57:37.680 --> 00:57:40.560
Are fully aligned once
more… An eternal dream

00:57:40.600 --> 00:57:43.060
A celebration this night
And now, let it all begin

00:58:33.900 --> 00:58:35.450
What's happening?!

00:58:35.820 --> 00:58:37.870
The demonic aura's
getting stronger!

00:58:38.280 --> 00:58:41.040
She stops time with
her undisturbed mind

00:58:41.540 --> 00:58:43.960
and destroys all living beings.

00:58:51.130 --> 00:58:53.170
There's a glow
beyond the forest.

00:58:53.880 --> 00:58:55.300
Are you going, Inuyasha?

00:58:55.340 --> 00:58:59.850
I think it's better to
stay away from danger.

00:59:00.100 --> 00:59:01.970
Then, don't concern yourself!

00:59:02.140 --> 00:59:03.640
You can wait here.

00:59:03.890 --> 00:59:04.940
Inuyasha!

00:59:05.600 --> 00:59:06.850
Akitoki, this is bad!

00:59:06.980 --> 00:59:10.570
If demons accost us
now, we'll be dead meat!

00:59:10.860 --> 00:59:12.230
I agree!

01:00:06.910 --> 01:00:08.210
Let's go, Kirara!

01:00:14.550 --> 01:00:15.210
Kirara!

01:00:19.720 --> 01:00:22.010
Master,
we can't get close to it!

01:00:22.220 --> 01:00:23.470
Watch out, Hachi!

01:00:25.430 --> 01:00:26.270
Miroku!

01:00:39.070 --> 01:00:40.700
Hachi, are you all right?!

01:00:40.740 --> 01:00:42.030
It's not a serious wound, Hachi!

01:00:43.780 --> 01:00:44.490
Hachi!

01:00:46.370 --> 01:00:47.790
Hachi!

01:00:48.910 --> 01:00:49.460
Huh?

01:00:59.720 --> 01:01:01.970
Kohaku, hang on tight!

01:01:02.300 --> 01:01:03.140
Miss Sango…

01:01:07.810 --> 01:01:09.020
There's something in the water!

01:01:18.900 --> 01:01:19.610
Sango!

01:01:20.450 --> 01:01:21.280
Shippo?

01:01:21.990 --> 01:01:22.990
Kagome!

01:01:23.990 --> 01:01:24.990
Inuyasha!

01:01:25.700 --> 01:01:27.200
So you've appeared, half-demon.

01:01:31.960 --> 01:01:35.420
Kagome, are you all right?!

01:01:38.090 --> 01:01:39.170
Inuyasha…

01:01:43.890 --> 01:01:45.010
Inuyasha…

01:01:45.680 --> 01:01:47.060
Inuyasha!

01:01:48.020 --> 01:01:49.890
The wound has disappeared.

01:01:51.020 --> 01:01:53.560
Behold the power of
the Celestial Robe.

01:01:55.020 --> 01:01:56.860
My wish will become true.

01:01:59.030 --> 01:01:59.990
Kagome…

01:02:00.360 --> 01:02:02.200
I'm coming to save you!

01:02:02.700 --> 01:02:04.030
So hang in there!

01:02:04.070 --> 01:02:05.820
Inuyasha!

01:02:12.040 --> 01:02:12.870
What's this?!

01:02:19.630 --> 01:02:21.340
W-What the hell?!

01:02:38.980 --> 01:02:39.730
Damn!

01:02:54.080 --> 01:02:56.330
I knew I shouldn't have come.

01:03:12.310 --> 01:03:13.100
Dammit!

01:03:25.490 --> 01:03:27.110
Wind Scar!

01:03:36.790 --> 01:03:38.750
What a waste of time!

01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:41.500
I'll use the Backlash Wave and
blast them all in one blow!

01:03:51.140 --> 01:03:53.220
I can't use the
Backlash Wave when

01:03:53.220 --> 01:03:55.480
they're coming at
me from everywhere!

01:03:56.560 --> 01:04:00.110
Now I possess limitless power.

01:04:01.070 --> 01:04:03.360
That robe doesn't suit a fake

01:04:03.360 --> 01:04:06.320
celestial maiden like
you, after all.

01:04:13.120 --> 01:04:13.990
Damn!

01:04:26.840 --> 01:04:29.180
Wouldn't attack one of your
own, huh?

01:04:35.890 --> 01:04:37.520
They would!

01:04:45.280 --> 01:04:46.360
Damn!

01:04:54.080 --> 01:04:56.790
I see… They're all
connected at the base.

01:04:57.330 --> 01:04:58.830
If I destroy that…

01:05:06.510 --> 01:05:07.590
Take this!

01:05:07.720 --> 01:05:11.220
Wind…Scar!

01:05:43.130 --> 01:05:44.210
That arrow!

01:05:47.840 --> 01:05:51.010
Inuyasha,
the rest I leave to you.

01:06:01.190 --> 01:06:02.770
That held me up too long!

01:06:10.280 --> 01:06:12.780
Huh? Defeated already?

01:06:13.280 --> 01:06:15.990
After all that
talk, how pitiful.

01:06:17.030 --> 01:06:21.290
Your fake celestial maiden
act is starting to wear thin.

01:06:21.660 --> 01:06:22.670
"Fake"?

01:06:23.290 --> 01:06:25.210
Then she's not a
real celestial being?

01:06:25.710 --> 01:06:27.500
Kanna told me…

01:06:28.170 --> 01:06:29.710
You're just like Naraku.

01:06:29.840 --> 01:06:32.260
A demon that absorbs the
flesh of other demons

01:06:32.260 --> 01:06:34.260
to increase your strength.

01:06:35.300 --> 01:06:38.600
I'll bet you devoured
the real maiden

01:06:38.640 --> 01:06:40.770
to gain immortality.

01:06:46.310 --> 01:06:47.480
Kagome!

01:06:55.610 --> 01:06:57.950
Naraku must've
really wanted that

01:06:57.990 --> 01:07:00.120
eternally young body of yours.

01:07:01.330 --> 01:07:04.460
Humph… I detest all
these half-demons.

01:07:05.540 --> 01:07:08.750
Your hatred goes pretty
deep, huh?

01:07:09.460 --> 01:07:13.260
But I am a woman
borne out of Naraku.

01:07:13.630 --> 01:07:16.680
And I'm really getting
tired of your antics.

01:07:17.010 --> 01:07:20.220
So you'll put on a side show?

01:07:21.970 --> 01:07:25.020
How about I suck out your soul?

01:07:38.530 --> 01:07:40.370
What's the matter, Kanna?!

01:07:40.830 --> 01:07:45.370
Fools! You think you
can easily take my soul?

01:07:46.580 --> 01:07:51.380
I shall tell you just why I
sought the Celestial Robe.

01:07:56.380 --> 01:07:58.470
Power of the Mirror
of Stillness!

01:08:08.560 --> 01:08:14.070
Damn! I can't move.

01:08:21.330 --> 01:08:23.910
Do these things
really heal injuries?

01:08:24.290 --> 01:08:27.410
Kagome's first-aid kit has
things with strange powers.

01:08:27.710 --> 01:08:32.130
Shippo, you were never
more courageous than today.

01:08:32.630 --> 01:08:34.840
I guess you can be
useful sometimes.

01:08:35.130 --> 01:08:37.880
Akitoki, make sure his
bandage is extra tight.

01:08:38.010 --> 01:08:38.510
Yes!

01:08:38.800 --> 01:08:39.970
Oww!

01:08:40.800 --> 01:08:42.600
Hey, I was praising you!

01:08:43.430 --> 01:08:44.430
Didn't sound like it to me.

01:08:45.220 --> 01:08:47.980
Hey, Akitoki!
Put a bandage on the knee.

01:08:48.190 --> 01:08:48.560
Yes.

01:08:50.150 --> 01:08:52.440
Shippo, who is this?

01:08:52.610 --> 01:08:53.400
Huh?

01:08:53.610 --> 01:08:56.570
I believe I've
met you somewhere…

01:08:56.900 --> 01:08:58.700
Oh, really?

01:08:59.150 --> 01:09:02.240
Ignore him.
He's not worth an introduction.

01:09:10.080 --> 01:09:12.130
Hey, what're you doing, Miroku?

01:09:12.420 --> 01:09:15.170
I don't feel quite
right without it.

01:09:15.880 --> 01:09:19.470
Hmm… I can't write
well with my left hand.

01:09:41.240 --> 01:09:42.240
So he's come.

01:09:42.360 --> 01:09:43.490
Inuyasha!

01:09:43.780 --> 01:09:45.780
But he won't get in my way.

01:09:53.830 --> 01:09:55.460
Kagome!

01:09:58.260 --> 01:10:00.630
Those who move within
the flow of time…

01:10:01.470 --> 01:10:04.090
disappear into the
empty void of illusion.

01:10:04.550 --> 01:10:06.350
Inuyasha, stay back!

01:10:08.350 --> 01:10:09.810
Power of the Mirror
of Stillness!

01:10:22.530 --> 01:10:24.160
Inuyasha!

01:10:53.060 --> 01:10:54.310
What's happening?!

01:10:57.520 --> 01:11:00.400
It's Kaguya's Power of
the Mirror of Stillness.

01:11:01.530 --> 01:11:03.150
She's making time stop?

01:11:03.950 --> 01:11:05.570
It's coming! It's coming!

01:11:07.320 --> 01:11:08.580
It's all over!

01:11:08.580 --> 01:11:11.580
Pa… I'll join you soon!

01:11:13.750 --> 01:11:14.580
Huh?

01:11:16.130 --> 01:11:17.130
I'm okay.

01:11:17.840 --> 01:11:18.920
But why?

01:11:18.960 --> 01:11:21.380
Akitoki and Hachiemon
aren't moving.

01:11:23.590 --> 01:11:24.510
This is…?!

01:11:27.260 --> 01:11:29.010
Kagome's medicine box!

01:11:29.180 --> 01:11:34.020
It seems Kagome's things can
put up a barrier against time.

01:11:34.390 --> 01:11:35.230
Huh?

01:11:44.650 --> 01:11:46.610
My eyes are burning!

01:11:47.610 --> 01:11:49.660
Didn't we go overboard?

01:11:49.660 --> 01:11:50.990
You're right.

01:11:57.460 --> 01:11:59.920
Oh,
my beautiful perpetual night…

01:11:59.960 --> 01:12:02.050
No one shall get in our way.

01:12:04.670 --> 01:12:06.760
It ain't over yet.

01:12:07.130 --> 01:12:08.010
Inuyasha!

01:12:08.050 --> 01:12:10.100
Huh? You!

01:12:10.100 --> 01:12:11.350
Why do you still move?!

01:12:11.640 --> 01:12:13.640
Who the hell knows?!

01:12:18.230 --> 01:12:19.610
That pendant!

01:12:20.520 --> 01:12:22.650
And he said he didn't want it!

01:12:25.860 --> 01:12:30.160
Now it's payback time
for all you've done!

01:12:38.500 --> 01:12:39.120
What?!

01:12:41.790 --> 01:12:42.880
Inuyasha!

01:12:43.670 --> 01:12:44.550
Kagome!

01:12:50.680 --> 01:12:51.680
Inuyasha!

01:12:53.560 --> 01:12:54.430
Inuyasha!

01:12:54.720 --> 01:12:55.850
Where did you go?

01:12:58.480 --> 01:13:02.690
Unsightly half-demon!
He was never here.

01:13:04.690 --> 01:13:05.690
An illusion?

01:13:10.240 --> 01:13:12.160
This is the dream of
the pentacle mirror.

01:13:12.200 --> 01:13:15.700
Illusion… The castle
beyond the looking glass.

01:13:17.160 --> 01:13:18.210
Inuyasha!

01:13:19.500 --> 01:13:20.620
You're all right?

01:13:21.580 --> 01:13:22.540
Where's Kagome?

01:13:22.710 --> 01:13:24.750
Kaguya took her into the castle.

01:13:26.800 --> 01:13:28.720
Where did the
castle disappear to?

01:13:29.680 --> 01:13:30.720
Take a look.

01:13:31.090 --> 01:13:31.720
Huh?!

01:13:40.230 --> 01:13:44.190
Inuyasha, what's with that
unsightly sleeve of yours?

01:13:45.690 --> 01:13:46.360
Oww!

01:13:46.650 --> 01:13:48.400
Why take it out on me?!

01:13:49.070 --> 01:13:49.860
Shaddup!

01:13:59.710 --> 01:14:00.750
In here?

01:14:02.750 --> 01:14:03.630
Kohaku?

01:14:04.670 --> 01:14:05.630
Kohaku!

01:14:06.750 --> 01:14:07.550
Let's go!

01:14:08.550 --> 01:14:09.380
Kohaku!

01:14:12.760 --> 01:14:14.720
'Kay! Me too.

01:14:17.390 --> 01:14:19.770
But…I'm just a little kid!

01:14:22.100 --> 01:14:23.770
Wait for me!

01:14:29.320 --> 01:14:31.360
Where is everyone?

01:14:34.110 --> 01:14:37.160
Wait! Don't leave me!

01:14:44.790 --> 01:14:48.880
Such fools… Pursuing
me inside the mirror.

01:14:49.250 --> 01:14:50.300
Hey, you!

01:14:50.800 --> 01:14:52.840
What's so good
about stopping time?

01:14:53.260 --> 01:14:57.810
Only humans like you
prefer time that passes.

01:14:58.140 --> 01:15:00.430
I'd rather die than stay
in a place like this!

01:15:01.810 --> 01:15:02.940
Don't worry.

01:15:03.690 --> 01:15:06.150
I am going to devour you.

01:15:09.150 --> 01:15:11.490
You possess the spiritual
powers of a priestess

01:15:11.490 --> 01:15:13.820
and are able to put up
a barrier against time.

01:15:13.820 --> 01:15:15.410
Those powers shall be mine!

01:15:18.410 --> 01:15:20.410
Kaguya…!

01:15:20.870 --> 01:15:21.830
Inuyasha!

01:15:29.590 --> 01:15:31.840
You're all okay!

01:15:31.960 --> 01:15:33.920
All thanks to your medicine!

01:15:39.390 --> 01:15:42.890
Tell me, have you decided
to become my servant?

01:15:43.140 --> 01:15:44.480
Don't count on it!

01:15:54.820 --> 01:15:55.950
Damn it!

01:15:55.950 --> 01:15:57.240
I can't stand idly by!

01:15:57.700 --> 01:15:58.530
Divine punishment!

01:16:12.380 --> 01:16:13.090
Sango!

01:16:14.420 --> 01:16:15.220
Sango!

01:16:18.800 --> 01:16:21.260
Iron Reaver Soul Stealer!

01:16:26.810 --> 01:16:27.850
Inuyasha!

01:16:29.270 --> 01:16:30.270
Inuyasha!

01:16:31.690 --> 01:16:32.820
Inuyasha!

01:16:35.030 --> 01:16:35.900
Fox Fire!

01:16:42.200 --> 01:16:43.910
You can take over, Miroku.

01:16:49.920 --> 01:16:51.590
Take a good look, Inuyasha…

01:16:51.880 --> 01:16:55.420
at the dark spirit which
lurks in your heart.

01:16:57.630 --> 01:16:59.430
What're you babbling about?

01:16:59.550 --> 01:17:02.220
This is the true
form you desire.

01:17:02.970 --> 01:17:05.930
I shall grant your wish.

01:17:19.610 --> 01:17:20.570
Inuyasha!

01:17:20.950 --> 01:17:21.950
Inuyasha!

01:17:27.410 --> 01:17:30.790
The world of the night
is where I rule supreme.

01:17:30.960 --> 01:17:33.960
I possess the power of darkness!

01:17:34.090 --> 01:17:38.970
I shall release your true
form from the mirror!

01:17:42.010 --> 01:17:42.970
Inuyasha!

01:17:43.970 --> 01:17:45.970
He's transforming
into his demon form!

01:17:45.970 --> 01:17:48.850
But it's different from before.

01:17:48.980 --> 01:17:50.810
No! You mustn't transform!

01:17:57.740 --> 01:18:00.030
Look at Inuyasha in the mirror!

01:18:00.030 --> 01:18:01.780
He's transforming!

01:18:04.450 --> 01:18:06.370
This is your true form!

01:18:06.490 --> 01:18:09.000
Become the true demon
monster that you wish to be!

01:18:09.660 --> 01:18:13.380
Forever seal your human
blood in this mirror.

01:18:15.000 --> 01:18:16.050
What's going on?!

01:18:16.630 --> 01:18:19.010
It's over if he transforms
into a full demon.

01:18:19.010 --> 01:18:21.680
He can never be a
half-demon again.

01:18:22.010 --> 01:18:23.010
What did you say?!

01:18:23.840 --> 01:18:27.390
But Inuyasha is able to
stop the transformation now!

01:18:27.640 --> 01:18:29.730
This is the world
of the mirrors.

01:18:30.310 --> 01:18:33.600
Perhaps the dark desire of
the heart is stronger in here.

01:18:34.230 --> 01:18:37.480
Does that mean he's changing
into a ferocious demon?

01:18:37.780 --> 01:18:38.570
Exactly.

01:18:38.980 --> 01:18:41.820
If we break the
mirror, we can stop it!

01:18:43.610 --> 01:18:44.570
Sister!

01:18:46.780 --> 01:18:47.620
Sister…!

01:18:54.710 --> 01:18:55.380
Kirara!

01:18:59.250 --> 01:19:00.300
Kagome!

01:19:01.670 --> 01:19:03.300
I'll get you out!

01:19:06.010 --> 01:19:06.930
Inuyasha!

01:19:07.050 --> 01:19:08.100
Snap out of it!

01:19:08.100 --> 01:19:11.230
Will you sell your soul to
Kaguya and forget about us?!

01:19:21.440 --> 01:19:22.740
Well done.

01:19:23.070 --> 01:19:25.530
Only by releasing
the power of darkness

01:19:25.570 --> 01:19:27.830
can one realize true freedom.

01:19:28.370 --> 01:19:32.080
Kagome… Inuyasha is
still unsure of himself.

01:19:32.120 --> 01:19:34.160
But we can't reach him.

01:19:34.920 --> 01:19:37.250
Only you can stop him!

01:19:39.210 --> 01:19:42.630
More than ever,
I wish I had my Wind Tunnel.

01:19:51.100 --> 01:19:51.850
Inuyasha!

01:19:51.890 --> 01:19:52.600
No!

01:19:53.100 --> 01:19:54.520
No!

01:19:57.900 --> 01:19:59.110
The Sacred Jewel shards…

01:19:59.690 --> 01:20:01.110
Shippo, please!

01:20:01.940 --> 01:20:03.780
Get my Jewel shards!

01:20:04.780 --> 01:20:05.700
Alright!

01:20:05.700 --> 01:20:07.740
Throw the whole bottle at me!

01:20:08.120 --> 01:20:08.820
'Kay!

01:20:12.450 --> 01:20:13.450
Go!

01:20:22.130 --> 01:20:23.090
Inuyasha!

01:20:24.760 --> 01:20:26.590
Stop this! I beg you!

01:20:26.800 --> 01:20:28.180
Don't transform!

01:20:34.850 --> 01:20:35.770
Inuyasha…

01:20:36.560 --> 01:20:38.190
Try what you will, it's useless.

01:20:38.650 --> 01:20:40.980
The human heart
which he possessed

01:20:40.980 --> 01:20:42.690
is locked in this mirror.

01:20:43.150 --> 01:20:45.110
He can never be a
half-demon again.

01:20:47.450 --> 01:20:50.870
Kagome! Move away!
You'll be killed!

01:20:51.780 --> 01:20:54.830
I love you as a
half-demon, Inuyasha!

01:20:55.160 --> 01:20:57.120
I like you just the way you are.

01:20:58.170 --> 01:21:01.170
Just be you, Inuyasha.

01:21:10.180 --> 01:21:13.390
Inuyasha!

01:21:27.190 --> 01:21:30.610
I love you as a
half-demon, Inuyasha.

01:21:34.580 --> 01:21:37.540
What's the matter, Inuyasha?
Why the hesitation?

01:21:46.710 --> 01:21:48.840
How can I stop his
transformation?

01:22:08.690 --> 01:22:09.900
Kagome…

01:22:10.240 --> 01:22:13.450
Set free the beast of
carnage inside you…

01:22:13.820 --> 01:22:17.290
And bring me the
flesh of that girl!

01:22:18.290 --> 01:22:21.420
Inuyasha, you want to stay
by my side, don't you?

01:22:32.800 --> 01:22:33.890
What is happening?!

01:22:35.050 --> 01:22:35.600
Huh?

01:22:37.680 --> 01:22:38.560
Kagome…

01:22:41.060 --> 01:22:42.270
What's this?

01:22:44.270 --> 01:22:47.270
Inuyasha, you're okay?

01:22:47.570 --> 01:22:48.730
Kagome!

01:22:55.410 --> 01:22:58.290
Silly fool,
why are you always so reckless?

01:22:59.620 --> 01:23:02.920
I'll stay a half-demon a
while longer. Just for you.

01:23:04.960 --> 01:23:07.340
Don't! Stop that, Miroku!

01:23:07.460 --> 01:23:09.170
Don't get any ideas!

01:23:10.510 --> 01:23:11.300
Sango…

01:23:14.510 --> 01:23:18.310
Fool! Casting away the chance
to have your desires granted.

01:23:21.310 --> 01:23:23.390
Come into my arms!

01:23:24.060 --> 01:23:25.980
Kohaku! Are you all right?

01:23:30.480 --> 01:23:31.360
Idiot!

01:23:37.660 --> 01:23:40.200
A mere half-demon
bares his fangs

01:23:40.240 --> 01:23:42.330
at me? You shall regret it.

01:23:51.800 --> 01:23:52.340
Huh?

01:23:53.010 --> 01:23:55.130
The Robe of the Fire-rat
has returned to its place!

01:23:59.300 --> 01:24:01.350
Wind Scar!

01:24:10.940 --> 01:24:11.860
What?!

01:24:16.610 --> 01:24:18.620
So you're no
different from Naraku!

01:24:18.870 --> 01:24:20.870
That makes things easier!

01:24:26.170 --> 01:24:27.540
What's the matter, Kohaku?

01:24:28.380 --> 01:24:30.210
My shoulder is burning!

01:24:36.130 --> 01:24:37.340
This can't be…!

01:24:46.390 --> 01:24:47.440
The Wind Tunnel?!

01:24:48.400 --> 01:24:49.520
What did you say?!

01:24:50.230 --> 01:24:52.690
Hurry, Miroku! Cover it up!

01:24:53.400 --> 01:24:55.400
Get away from me, Sister!

01:24:55.860 --> 01:24:56.650
Kohaku!

01:25:00.870 --> 01:25:02.280
What's happening?

01:25:02.410 --> 01:25:03.410
It can't be…!

01:25:03.990 --> 01:25:05.540
Looks like it.

01:25:07.830 --> 01:25:09.790
Kohaku, hang in there!

01:25:10.420 --> 01:25:11.420
Run away!

01:25:11.840 --> 01:25:12.630
No!

01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:14.840
I'll never leave you again!

01:25:25.220 --> 01:25:25.980
Sango!

01:25:31.440 --> 01:25:32.480
Naraku!

01:25:32.730 --> 01:25:35.480
It's been a while, Kaguya.

01:25:36.030 --> 01:25:37.070
Naraku…

01:25:37.440 --> 01:25:39.450
I thought you had died.

01:25:39.700 --> 01:25:43.660
I did. Just long
enough to lure you out.

01:25:44.280 --> 01:25:46.450
So you faked your
death for a while

01:25:46.450 --> 01:25:48.460
and erased my Wind Tunnel?!

01:25:51.000 --> 01:25:54.420
How cruel!
How could he do this?!

01:25:57.260 --> 01:26:00.470
Inuyasha! Naraku intends
to absorb Kaguya!

01:26:00.470 --> 01:26:01.300
What?!

01:26:01.930 --> 01:26:03.350
You will not get in my way.

01:26:03.470 --> 01:26:06.470
Hang on!
I'll cut you away from Naraku!

01:26:07.470 --> 01:26:08.730
Run, Sango!

01:26:08.730 --> 01:26:10.600
Let me go, Miroku!

01:26:10.850 --> 01:26:13.440
Naraku will absorb you too!

01:26:17.030 --> 01:26:19.110
Damn you, Naraku!

01:26:19.150 --> 01:26:21.490
No! He has Kohaku!

01:26:22.490 --> 01:26:23.570
I know that!

01:26:24.490 --> 01:26:27.410
Become one with my flesh!

01:26:29.500 --> 01:26:32.290
Do not touch me with
your disgusting body!

01:26:49.180 --> 01:26:50.140
Kohaku!

01:26:51.310 --> 01:26:52.060
Kagome!

01:27:30.180 --> 01:27:31.430
Where's Naraku?!

01:27:31.560 --> 01:27:32.560
Is he dead?

01:27:33.060 --> 01:27:34.940
No. He's not dead.

01:27:35.560 --> 01:27:37.560
He's hiding somewhere.

01:27:37.560 --> 01:27:39.860
Damn it! He's just going
to watch from the shadows!

01:27:40.400 --> 01:27:42.150
If we defeat Kaguya,

01:27:42.280 --> 01:27:45.530
Naraku will consume her
body and become immortal.

01:27:45.700 --> 01:27:49.450
But if Kaguya wins,
then Naraku would be rid of us.

01:27:49.580 --> 01:27:52.160
In either case, Naraku benefits.

01:27:52.750 --> 01:27:57.580
From the beginning,
we were just pawns in his game.

01:27:58.000 --> 01:27:59.630
Quit babbling.

01:27:59.960 --> 01:28:00.880
Inuyasha!

01:28:01.340 --> 01:28:03.800
We just kill them both
and solve the problem!

01:28:04.050 --> 01:28:08.180
Well, I can use my Wind
Tunnel to my heart's content.

01:28:08.350 --> 01:28:09.890
Don't you interfere!

01:28:11.140 --> 01:28:12.850
Kaguya is mine!

01:28:25.610 --> 01:28:28.030
You do not have the
power to defeat me.

01:28:29.240 --> 01:28:31.620
Please Shippo…
Change into a bow.

01:28:31.910 --> 01:28:34.160
A bow? But there's no arrow.

01:28:34.370 --> 01:28:35.660
It's all right, just hurry.

01:28:40.630 --> 01:28:41.630
Why you—!

01:28:49.970 --> 01:28:50.640
No!

01:28:53.520 --> 01:28:54.890
The mirror is glowing!

01:28:55.100 --> 01:28:56.640
It's the one that
blasted Naraku.

01:29:00.650 --> 01:29:01.650
Wind Tunnel!

01:29:09.660 --> 01:29:12.660
Hey, Miroku,
I said stay out of it!

01:29:12.660 --> 01:29:14.330
I knew you'd say that.

01:29:22.460 --> 01:29:23.500
Kagome!

01:29:44.480 --> 01:29:45.440
She's coming again!

01:29:45.990 --> 01:29:48.820
Inuyasha!
A direct attack won't work!

01:29:48.860 --> 01:29:50.320
Shaddup!

01:29:50.700 --> 01:29:53.700
Disappear into
perpetual darkness!

01:29:58.250 --> 01:30:01.080
Take this! Backlash Wave!

01:30:05.840 --> 01:30:07.720
That trick won't work on me.

01:30:15.680 --> 01:30:16.270
She's gone.

01:30:16.270 --> 01:30:18.020
Inuyasha,
it's coming right back!

01:30:18.350 --> 01:30:19.600
I know!

01:30:27.230 --> 01:30:28.860
A frontal attack's the only way!

01:30:31.740 --> 01:30:33.490
Ready, Shippo?

01:30:33.530 --> 01:30:34.330
Yeah…

01:30:34.740 --> 01:30:35.830
Oww!

01:30:35.830 --> 01:30:36.740
Sorry!

01:30:36.740 --> 01:30:39.410
Never mind me! Shoot!

01:30:41.870 --> 01:30:45.460
Wind Scar!

01:30:50.470 --> 01:30:53.760
You don't have the
power to push it back…

01:30:53.800 --> 01:30:55.350
Go!

01:31:01.770 --> 01:31:02.600
Huh?!

01:31:10.780 --> 01:31:11.780
How's that?!

01:31:16.530 --> 01:31:20.290
A mere half-demon…
and a mere human….

01:31:22.670 --> 01:31:23.790
We did it!

01:31:29.590 --> 01:31:31.260
Are you all right, Kagome?

01:31:31.720 --> 01:31:33.550
Thanks, Sango!

01:31:34.930 --> 01:31:36.390
We're fine here!

01:31:36.390 --> 01:31:37.810
He's such a headache!

01:31:44.600 --> 01:31:45.810
What is that?!

01:31:49.360 --> 01:31:50.860
My body may be destroyed.

01:31:50.900 --> 01:31:52.780
But I am an immortal
celestial being.

01:31:52.820 --> 01:31:54.820
You there,
with the sacred powers.

01:31:54.820 --> 01:31:57.320
You will be my new flesh!

01:31:59.740 --> 01:32:00.490
Kagome!

01:32:02.000 --> 01:32:02.910
Kagome!

01:32:12.840 --> 01:32:13.720
Naraku!

01:32:13.840 --> 01:32:15.680
Come, Kaguya.

01:32:17.890 --> 01:32:19.100
Kagome!

01:32:19.100 --> 01:32:20.350
Get down!

01:32:27.020 --> 01:32:28.270
Inuyasha!

01:32:28.810 --> 01:32:29.860
Wind Tunnel!

01:32:37.870 --> 01:32:39.200
Are you all right, Kagome?

01:32:39.370 --> 01:32:40.280
Kagome!

01:32:43.080 --> 01:32:44.080
Kohaku!

01:32:50.750 --> 01:32:52.090
Let us hurry!

01:32:52.300 --> 01:32:54.260
How do we get out?

01:32:54.880 --> 01:32:58.090
I think we can get back to the
surface by following Naraku.

01:33:13.900 --> 01:33:16.820
Wait! Don't leave me!

01:33:20.320 --> 01:33:21.780
Help!

01:33:21.780 --> 01:33:23.540
Inuyasha, you coward!

01:33:28.920 --> 01:33:29.920
Where's Kaguya?

01:33:30.330 --> 01:33:32.590
It's safe. She's gone.

01:33:32.840 --> 01:33:34.920
Take a look.

01:33:37.010 --> 01:33:38.930
The castle is disappearing.

01:33:41.430 --> 01:33:42.260
Look…

01:33:47.100 --> 01:33:48.560
It's all over.

01:33:49.060 --> 01:33:51.940
Not quite.

01:33:52.480 --> 01:33:54.730
Naraku is still alive.

01:33:55.110 --> 01:33:58.990
But we destroyed
what he was after.

01:33:59.240 --> 01:34:00.240
So that's something.

01:34:00.450 --> 01:34:02.950
Hah! Just one isn't enough!

01:34:03.370 --> 01:34:05.200
– Hey, Master Miroku! – Huh?

01:34:06.790 --> 01:34:07.660
Hachi!

01:34:13.840 --> 01:34:15.590
So you're both all right.

01:34:17.800 --> 01:34:20.970
Miss Kagome! The Celestial
Robe has returned.

01:34:20.970 --> 01:34:21.970
Huh?!

01:34:22.640 --> 01:34:25.220
And look, your staff!

01:34:25.970 --> 01:34:29.980
When I came to,
it suddenly fell from heaven.

01:34:29.980 --> 01:34:33.980
Wow… It returned to
its rightful owner!

01:34:34.320 --> 01:34:35.520
Just like a dog.

01:34:37.610 --> 01:34:38.320
Sango…

01:34:39.700 --> 01:34:42.910
Right at the end,
Kohaku called you "Sister."

01:34:43.410 --> 01:34:45.990
That's something at least.

01:34:46.700 --> 01:34:48.500
Thank you, Miroku…

01:34:50.000 --> 01:34:51.620
I think so too.

01:34:56.750 --> 01:35:01.010
Grandfather, you were right.
Kaguya was beautiful.

01:35:01.010 --> 01:35:02.010
Huh?!

01:35:02.180 --> 01:35:03.390
Miroku?!

01:35:03.640 --> 01:35:06.010
What are you thinking, Miroku?!

01:35:06.430 --> 01:35:09.480
Do not worry. You are the
only celestial maiden for me!

01:35:09.480 --> 01:35:10.180
Huh?!

01:35:11.020 --> 01:35:11.980
Oww!

01:35:12.940 --> 01:35:14.020
Idiot!

01:35:18.230 --> 01:35:22.030
The shooting star granted
a little part of my wish.

01:35:23.070 --> 01:35:26.030
Princess Kaguya of the
legend returned to the moon.

01:35:26.620 --> 01:35:29.040
But our journey will continue.

01:35:30.000 --> 01:35:31.080
Kagome!

01:35:31.710 --> 01:35:33.040
Kagome!

01:35:33.750 --> 01:35:34.880
Kagome!

01:35:35.170 --> 01:35:37.880
How mean of you to leave me!

01:35:38.050 --> 01:35:40.050
Then quit daydreaming!

01:35:40.050 --> 01:35:41.470
How rude!

01:35:41.470 --> 01:35:43.930
Come, come. We destroyed Kaguya.

01:35:43.930 --> 01:35:46.470
Yes, so no fighting for today.

01:38:17.580 --> 01:38:20.040
Oh, this feels sooo good.

01:38:20.210 --> 01:38:21.750
Oh yes!

01:38:23.380 --> 01:38:25.460
Sango, we too…

01:38:31.760 --> 01:38:33.720
What do you think you're doing?!

01:38:33.760 --> 01:38:38.520
Well… We should follow
Kagome's example and…

01:38:40.100 --> 01:38:42.650
No! I don't know anything!
I don't remember a thing!

01:38:42.650 --> 01:38:45.230
It wasn't like I
wanted to either!

01:38:45.230 --> 01:38:45.900
What?

01:38:46.780 --> 01:38:48.320
What does that mean?

01:38:48.320 --> 01:38:50.360
Err…nothing…

01:38:50.490 --> 01:38:52.240
Besides,
you're the one who came at me.

01:38:52.240 --> 01:38:54.870
Inuyasha! Sit!

01:38:59.080 --> 01:39:02.250
Inuyasha, grow up will you?
